          "ForeName": "J P",
          "LastName": "Rosenfeld",
          "Initials": "JP"
        }
      },
      "ArticleTitle": "The response of individual nucleus raphe magnus neurons to microinjections of met-enkephalin at midbrain and at bulbar loci: evidence for midbrain-bulbar convergence on individual raphe neurons.",
